{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃可盈（Melanie）日前在社交平台上載了一段短片，分享了一張她與陳子樂、梁暐昕等昔日童星好友在12年前拍下的珍貴合照。她感性地配文寫道：「你可能不知道我們是誰，但應該曾在電視上見過我們」。帖文曝光後隨即引起極大迴響，勾起無數劇迷的集體回憶。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"3343ebb6-3367-432b-abc5-66d9a89ca5bf.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026DRs7wXgcV71792552003.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>在影片中，黃可盈細數眾人當年參演過的經典劇集角色。當中包括黃可盈本人曾於《巾幗梟雄之諜血長天》中飾演胡杏兒角色「張寄生」的童年版；陳子樂曾客串演出《使徒行者》；而梁暐昕則在《公主嫁到》中飾演陳法拉角色「司徒銀屏」的童年版，其在《宮心計》中飾演楊茜堯角色「姚金鈴」的童年版更是深入民心。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"a17ae8cb-fdcc-46c1-b13e-35d2d19ee94a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026G6k5I7mzUw1792552002.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"fe93802d-3d07-4cf4-80a3-44bd8ca57e33.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026nKQRkrAdox1792552002.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"52b20380-c312-457c-8dec-a94f148599ab.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026roByoeLUzm1792552001.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"b9e47ccd-59f4-4966-8d9e-bab75a37f5cf.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026JIE5V2zPX21792552000.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>黃可盈在帖文中續問網民：「小時候在電視台認識的好朋友們！原來已經12年了！大家認得我們我們還拍過什麼劇嗎？」雖然時光飛逝逾十年，但眾人私下依然保持聯絡，不時聚首敘舊，這份難得的友情實在令人羨慕。</p><p></p><p>大批網民紛紛留言感嘆時光飛逝：「哇都睇過」、「回憶啊」，更有不少人指梁暐昕與黃可盈絕對是由細靚到大，紛紛大讚「《公主嫁到》妹妹好深刻」、「越大越靚女」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T03:20:17.371929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:48.500850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T03:17:40.626562+00:00","content_hash":"c6ebc457635bbe26ef4392553d2fe3eddb082c39e0fe04631d4378e0cc234c3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}